Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 11:27:16 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] app: secureStorage.test: e2e-tests: Cover legacy token
 upgrades

Existing scoped-storage tests do not cover tokens saved by earlier AKS
Desktop releases. Specify trusted migration, ciphertext preservation,
quota boundaries, failed-write recovery, and legacy-token retirement so
the implementation can be reviewed against upgrade behavior.

Exercise the production storage handlers and preload in real Electron
with a disposable profile and synthetic encrypted token. Check namespace
denial, restart persistence, and sign-out without a real GitHub account.
Keep fixture setup isolated from the full application and clean its files
even when compilation, launch, or shutdown fails.
